    <title>Attention Is All You Need: Revisited with Sparse Transformers</title>
    <summary>We revisit the original Transformer architecture and propose a sparse attention
mechanism that reduces computational complexity from O(n^2) to O(n log n)
while maintaining state-of-the-art performance on multiple benchmarks. Our
method achieves significant speedups on long-sequence tasks.</summary>
