    <title>Large Language Models as
    Reasoning Agents: A Survey</title>
    <summary>This survey examines recent advances in using large language models as autonomous
reasoning agents. We categorize existing approaches and identify open challenges
in areas such as tool use, memory management, and multi-step planning.</summary>
